			"notes": "### Features\n- **config**: show personal bests and run counts at the top of Critter Safari\n- **safari**: record who hunted each run and when every biome was cleared\n- **chat**: optionally answer critter prompts with Sure\n- **safari**: treat Macaw as a Forest bonus critter that does not block a clear\n- **hud**: let the total progress bar be turned off\n\n### Fixes\n- **chat**: log why a critter prompt was not answered and follow inherited click events\n- **config**: separate runs in the history and write 10 instead of ten\n- **config**: let the run history fill the page instead of one clipped line\n- **safari**: recognise the safari by the Captured Mobs sidebar line as well\n- **chat**: stop counting an uncovered disguised Duplico as a capture\n- **chat**: count a capture even when the location sources have not caught up yet\n- **safari**: start a new run when hopping straight from one safari into another\n- **ci**: warn against backfilling old versions to Modrinth\n\n**Full changelog**: https://github.com/soldey/SafariGroupHelper/compare/v1.5.2...v1.6.0"
		},
